WEBVTT

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:10.698
<i>GRENADIER</i>

00:00:10.939 --> 00:00:20.439
<i>Carving my footsteps
in the amber colored road...</i>

00:00:20.549 --> 00:00:30.254
<i>... I've finally come this far.
I keep my eyes on the road ahead.</i>

00:00:30.525 --> 00:00:39.661
<i>Only time moves faster than me...</i>

00:00:40.068 --> 00:00:50.205
<i>... I look back, and
the road behind me shines blue.</i>

00:00:51.213 --> 00:00:57.174
<i>The flames of all the lives
I've encountered...</i>

00:00:57.385 --> 00:01:00.786
<i>I wish I could hold them in my arms.</i>

00:01:00.956 --> 00:01:06.622
<i>So that we don't get swept away
by this great river...</i>

00:01:06.762 --> 00:01:10.289
<i>... I want our hearts to be one.</i>

00:01:10.465 --> 00:01:19.464
<i>We're all travelers, after all.</i>

00:01:40.796 --> 00:01:44.129
Are you sure we're going
towards the capitol?

00:01:44.366 --> 00:01:46.357
Of course we are.

00:01:46.468 --> 00:01:51.303
There are many people like you who
enter from the Charambo Mountain side.

00:01:51.406 --> 00:01:56.742
Trust me, I've crossed
this lake many times.

00:01:56.878 --> 00:01:59.745
But this place sure is nasty.

00:02:00.081 --> 00:02:01.412
Right, Yajiro?

00:02:04.586 --> 00:02:06.247
What's up with him!

00:02:06.354 --> 00:02:12.589
But thanks to this fog, the Capitol
has prospered for hundreds of years.

00:02:13.328 --> 00:02:18.527
Even if the enemy attacks, they can't see
through the fog, so they can't even get...

00:02:18.633 --> 00:02:21.659
...close to the capitol.

00:02:23.905 --> 00:02:27.705
<i>Episode 10
Entering Tento</i>

00:02:28.977 --> 00:02:30.137
Listen up!

00:02:30.245 --> 00:02:33.737
Do not forget about those
who died on the way here!

00:02:33.882 --> 00:02:37.045
No matter what happens,
we will accomplish our goal!

00:02:37.185 --> 00:02:40.780
Yeah!

00:02:42.757 --> 00:02:45.021
Everything is for world unity.

00:02:45.193 --> 00:02:50.688
I was looking for the strongest life I could
find, no matter if it was our enemy or ally.

00:02:54.236 --> 00:02:57.569
He used us.

00:02:57.839 --> 00:03:00.831
Come to think of it,
about a year and a half ago...

00:03:00.976 --> 00:03:06.141
...there was a stupid band of swordsmen
who tried to attack the capitol.

00:03:06.781 --> 00:03:09.841
Most of them died...

00:03:15.257 --> 00:03:16.656
What's going on?

00:03:16.758 --> 00:03:17.554
I don't know!

00:03:17.692 --> 00:03:20.388
It's coming from the lake!
There's something in there!

00:03:20.662 --> 00:03:21.356
What!

00:03:30.772 --> 00:03:35.436
They were demolished by
the lake and disappeared.

00:03:36.511 --> 00:03:39.036
But some of them survived, right?

00:03:39.214 --> 00:03:44.015
Yes, I heard that some of
them swam to the capitol.

00:03:44.686 --> 00:03:49.350
It's said that there are still some of
the lawless bandits hiding in the capitol.

00:03:49.691 --> 00:03:53.092
I can't allow any other outlaws to enter!

00:03:53.762 --> 00:03:54.751
You!

00:03:55.063 --> 00:03:56.860
Yajiro spoke!

00:03:57.265 --> 00:03:59.859
Rushuna, Yajiro spoke!

00:04:00.068 --> 00:04:01.831
Hmm? What?

00:04:02.003 --> 00:04:06.531
When I say outlaws,
I mean you, Rushuna Tendo!

00:04:18.453 --> 00:04:20.751
Yatchan! Mikan!

00:04:36.938 --> 00:04:38.997
Where is Rushuna? Rushuna!

00:04:43.712 --> 00:04:45.543
<i>He, he, he,
welcome to my territory.</i>

00:04:48.216 --> 00:04:50.309
<i>My name is Suiro!
Shinnoshin Hakubi!</i>

00:04:50.418 --> 00:04:53.216
<i>I am an Juttensen specializing
in Underwater Fighting Skills.</i>

00:04:53.989 --> 00:04:56.457
<i>You're a Juttensen?</i>

00:05:11.139 --> 00:05:15.041
<i>Where do you think you are?
You're in the water.</i>

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:18.668
<i>The bumps and dings in the bullets
that don't matter in the air...</i>

00:05:19.581 --> 00:05:22.482
<i>... meet a lot of resistance in water!</i>

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:24.618
What a busy guy.

00:05:24.819 --> 00:05:26.377
I think I have some...

00:05:27.989 --> 00:05:29.354
<i>Special underwater bullets</i>

00:05:36.297 --> 00:05:38.788
Screw bullets? That's clever.

00:05:38.967 --> 00:05:39.831
But!

00:05:44.072 --> 00:05:45.505
Against me...

00:05:45.707 --> 00:05:48.676
...those things are kids' toys!

00:05:53.348 --> 00:05:55.873
I'll show you something!

00:05:56.284 --> 00:05:59.048
This is the ultimate underwater weapon!

00:06:01.389 --> 00:06:02.378
A torpedo?

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:03.952
Rushuna!

00:06:04.125 --> 00:06:05.251
Rushuna!

00:06:06.861 --> 00:06:08.419
What was that?

00:06:09.431 --> 00:06:12.889
This attack! It's the same
as a year and a half ago!

00:06:13.468 --> 00:06:15.197
Rushuna's in trouble!

00:06:15.336 --> 00:06:16.325
Doshi!

00:06:17.172 --> 00:06:18.696
Come out!

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:23.207
Where are you?

00:06:23.311 --> 00:06:26.178
Yajiro, Rushuna's not coming up!

00:06:36.691 --> 00:06:39.125
I'm going to run out of air!

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:46.224
Mikan!

00:06:47.502 --> 00:06:48.764
Got it.

00:06:52.207 --> 00:06:53.799
Thank you.

00:06:55.376 --> 00:06:57.344
<i>Be careful not to
breathe in too much.</i>

00:06:59.747 --> 00:07:03.012
A Land Senshi can't handle it.

00:07:03.685 --> 00:07:05.653
You saved me, Mikan.

00:07:05.787 --> 00:07:08.187
But I can't win like this.

00:07:09.691 --> 00:07:12.592
The resistance of the water
allows him to dodge my bullets.

00:07:12.694 --> 00:07:15.219
I'll have to shoot
where there is no water.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:18.959
A place where there is no water?
Is there a place like that?

00:07:20.034 --> 00:07:21.058
I see it!

00:07:24.239 --> 00:07:26.002
I'll get him with the next one.

00:07:26.274 --> 00:07:27.741
Where are you, Doshi!

00:07:27.842 --> 00:07:30.675
I won't let anyone else die! Come out!

00:07:31.746 --> 00:07:33.611
Rushuna's alive!

00:07:38.486 --> 00:07:40.386
Take this!

00:07:46.294 --> 00:07:49.263
A place underwater where
there is less water resistance...

00:07:49.364 --> 00:07:52.731
A path of air underwater...
a tunnel of bubbles!

00:07:53.935 --> 00:07:55.630
Impossible!

00:08:08.449 --> 00:08:10.417
Rushuna! Rushuna!

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:13.915
You're okay!

00:08:14.989 --> 00:08:16.513
Who was that?

00:08:16.624 --> 00:08:18.023
A Juttensen.

00:08:18.259 --> 00:08:20.693
What's wrong with my voice?

00:08:23.131 --> 00:08:24.393
Huh?

00:08:24.532 --> 00:08:26.397
<i>Helium?</i>

00:08:26.534 --> 00:08:30.630
That's great! Check out your voice, huh?

00:08:31.606 --> 00:08:32.595
Why?

00:08:32.907 --> 00:08:35.432
Why are the Juttensen
attacking one by one?

00:08:35.543 --> 00:08:39.343
If they really wanted to kill us,
they'd attack all at once.

00:08:40.882 --> 00:08:45.512
But what I was really searching for
was a strong life.

00:08:46.554 --> 00:08:48.715
And he's always...

00:08:49.224 --> 00:08:50.020
Ouch.

00:08:50.258 --> 00:08:52.658
It's funny, laugh!

00:08:53.494 --> 00:08:56.327
You've been bent out of shape
since Charambo.

00:08:56.431 --> 00:08:58.228
What's going on with you?

00:08:58.333 --> 00:08:59.391
Mikan.

00:08:59.567 --> 00:09:02.195
I know it's hard to lose a friend...

00:09:02.303 --> 00:09:05.500
But are you really that weak?

00:09:05.673 --> 00:09:11.339
You have to live for your friends too!
So try to be happier about being alive!

00:09:12.413 --> 00:09:15.211
Don't talk like you know
what I'm going through!

00:09:15.316 --> 00:09:17.876
What's with that attitude
of yours! Look at me!

00:09:17.986 --> 00:09:18.953
Mikan...

00:09:19.053 --> 00:09:23.114
Rushuna, how long are you going to
stay there? Get out of the water.

00:09:23.291 --> 00:09:24.258
But...

00:09:24.592 --> 00:09:27.060
...my clothes are all torn.

00:09:31.666 --> 00:09:35.568
Jeez... I got beat.

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:39.230
How am I going to explain this?

00:09:40.275 --> 00:09:43.472
The Juttensen who was called
the master of Lake Hakusen...

00:09:43.645 --> 00:09:46.273
...even Suiro has been defeated.

00:09:46.848 --> 00:09:50.306
That woman sure is strong.

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:57.858
<i>5 hours later</i>

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:11.671
I see, Suiro too...

00:10:12.140 --> 00:10:17.510
Sanzo Souma the Blade Bard Senshi, and
Teppa Aizen the Gaifu-Senjyutsu Senshi.

00:10:17.645 --> 00:10:21.775
And also the Enchanting Snow Dance
Senshi, Fuuka Shirato...

00:10:21.949 --> 00:10:23.382
He's the fourth.

00:10:24.118 --> 00:10:26.382
Four of the Juttensen.

00:10:26.888 --> 00:10:30.824
We still don't know
where Teppa Aizen is, but...

00:10:31.659 --> 00:10:35.425
It's enough that we know he ran off.

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:36.656
Yes.

00:10:37.365 --> 00:10:40.129
Rushuna Tendo's reputation,
having defeated them...

00:10:40.234 --> 00:10:44.898
...is spreading through
the nation and beyond.

00:10:46.274 --> 00:10:49.641
Then it's my turn, isn't it?

00:10:52.313 --> 00:10:56.875
I can't wait to see Rushuna.
You understand, don't you?

00:10:59.287 --> 00:11:02.120
There's just one person
standing in the way.

00:11:04.125 --> 00:11:06.093
Leave it to me.

00:11:24.812 --> 00:11:26.973
Here, Teppa, ah...

00:11:27.081 --> 00:11:28.048
Ah...

00:11:30.518 --> 00:11:32.452
Is that persimmon good?

00:11:32.553 --> 00:11:34.350
Of course it is.

00:11:35.056 --> 00:11:39.755
You're too distracted to tell the difference
between an apple and a persimmon.

00:11:39.894 --> 00:11:41.623
You're horrible.

00:11:43.531 --> 00:11:45.192
Good evening.

00:11:45.299 --> 00:11:47.460
Teppa, will you play with me?

00:11:48.469 --> 00:11:54.101
Normally, the imperial soldiers would
be visiting right about now, but...

00:11:54.375 --> 00:11:57.344
But they've increased security.

00:11:57.445 --> 00:12:00.073
They've all been called out.

00:12:01.849 --> 00:12:03.339
She's here.

00:12:05.486 --> 00:12:08.421
You can't go dressed like that.

00:12:08.656 --> 00:12:12.456
But I have to see Tenshi
as soon as possible.

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:17.930
We've come this far, don't stress about
it now. Go to the hotel and change first.

00:12:18.332 --> 00:12:19.128
But...

00:12:19.567 --> 00:12:21.369
First, you have to take a bath.

00:12:21.369 --> 00:12:22.233
<i>A bath?
First, you have to take a bath.</i>

00:12:22.336 --> 00:12:23.805
You want to take one, don't you?

00:12:23.805 --> 00:12:25.238
<i>I do, but...
You want to take one, don't you?</i>

00:12:25.373 --> 00:12:29.309
Right, you should cleanse yourself,
then go see her.

00:12:29.444 --> 00:12:32.174
Yajiro, you're making so much sense.

00:12:32.313 --> 00:12:33.905
I agree with him.

00:12:34.182 --> 00:12:35.410
Um...

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:37.210
I see.

00:12:39.153 --> 00:12:42.316
I was just thinking
what a hot body you have...

00:12:42.423 --> 00:12:43.549
It's you!

00:12:43.658 --> 00:12:45.592
It's you again, you pervert!

00:12:45.693 --> 00:12:48.127
That's not a nice way to greet someone!

00:12:48.229 --> 00:12:50.527
So you came back to the capitol.

00:12:50.631 --> 00:12:54.829
When it comes to a place with lots of
girls, nothing beats the capitol.

00:12:54.936 --> 00:12:56.904
That is so you, Teppa.

00:12:57.271 --> 00:13:01.708
Please don't say my name so loud.
I'm also a wanted man.

00:13:01.843 --> 00:13:03.310
Hey, pervert.

00:13:04.612 --> 00:13:06.580
I don't like you calling me that.

00:13:06.681 --> 00:13:08.478
Whatever... come here...

00:13:12.753 --> 00:13:14.721
Now that's a pervert!

00:13:14.822 --> 00:13:17.814
He says he knows a bath
that the girls love.

00:13:17.925 --> 00:13:19.654
I know a great place.

00:13:19.794 --> 00:13:22.456
A bath where you can
sneak peaks at the girls?

00:13:22.563 --> 00:13:24.360
This place isn't like that.

00:13:24.465 --> 00:13:26.524
But I do know places like that.

00:13:26.634 --> 00:13:30.070
Let's have him take us to the safe one.

00:13:30.371 --> 00:13:31.133
Yes.

00:13:31.472 --> 00:13:34.236
And afterwards,
we can have a nice dinner.

00:13:34.375 --> 00:13:37.538
Now that you mention it, I am hungry.

00:13:37.678 --> 00:13:39.680
Now we have a plan, let's hurry.

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:41.580
<i>Yes, let's go.
Now we have a plan, let's hurry.</i>

00:13:43.784 --> 00:13:46.048
Something's fishy.

00:13:48.689 --> 00:13:50.418
This way, please.

00:13:50.525 --> 00:13:53.255
What a fantastic bathhouse!

00:13:53.427 --> 00:13:55.452
Hey! Where's Yajiro?

00:13:55.563 --> 00:13:59.124
The samurai said he had
to have some food first.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.094
Huh?

00:14:00.535 --> 00:14:01.900
He...

00:14:02.303 --> 00:14:03.861
What's wrong?

00:14:04.105 --> 00:14:07.973
I'm hungry too. I think I'll eat first.

00:14:08.175 --> 00:14:10.200
I'll catch up with you!

00:14:11.946 --> 00:14:15.677
Let's go wash off our sweat first.

00:14:16.317 --> 00:14:18.547
Don't tell me that he is...

00:14:30.865 --> 00:14:32.856
Is that you, Kasumi?

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:36.299
I'd heard that there were survivors,
but why are you dressed like that?

00:14:36.437 --> 00:14:40.999
A rebel has to take certain measures
to stay alive in the capitol.

00:14:41.142 --> 00:14:44.771
I want to get inside the castle.
Is the passage still useable?

00:14:44.912 --> 00:14:45.970
Sure.

00:14:46.113 --> 00:14:48.843
But what are you going
to do once you get in?

00:14:50.818 --> 00:14:52.186
We'll talk later.

00:14:52.186 --> 00:14:53.016
<i>Come.
We'll talk later.</i>

00:14:55.289 --> 00:14:58.122
He's going to see Tenshi first.

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:01.523
Hey, what are you doing?

00:15:01.896 --> 00:15:04.023
Huh? Um... good work!

00:15:04.131 --> 00:15:05.621
That's a dead end!

00:15:05.733 --> 00:15:08.827
Oh, my mistake, this way!

00:15:16.577 --> 00:15:21.378
The best way to relax after a long journey
is to warm your body from the core.

00:15:22.316 --> 00:15:24.113
Thank you, Teppa.

00:15:24.218 --> 00:15:25.014
Sure.

00:15:25.353 --> 00:15:29.585
Public baths have been really popular
here in the capitol lately.

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:33.057
Tenshi has built us some
wonderful things like this.

00:15:33.995 --> 00:15:35.428
Tenshi...

00:15:36.864 --> 00:15:40.425
But there are members of the court
who believe that they go against...

00:15:40.568 --> 00:15:43.765
...our customs, and have
called for them to be shut down.

00:15:44.405 --> 00:15:46.305
It's nonsense.

00:15:47.341 --> 00:15:50.538
I wonder what happened to Tenshi.

00:15:54.115 --> 00:15:57.551
It is a fact that there are some strange
things happening inside the castle.

00:15:57.685 --> 00:16:00.313
I will invite her to supper
in order to stall her...

00:16:00.855 --> 00:16:01.822
...and then...

00:16:02.056 --> 00:16:04.991
...I will do this and that...

00:16:07.662 --> 00:16:08.890
Kaizan Doshi?

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:12.557
He seems to be in cahoots with Tenshi.
Do you know anything about it?

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:17.660
No, those of us who live in the shadows
don't know what goes on in the castle.

00:16:21.776 --> 00:16:26.213
There's no other way to find out
other than to sneak into the castle.

00:16:27.048 --> 00:16:28.140
I see.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.482
Please.

00:16:34.689 --> 00:16:36.020
Thank you.

00:16:44.799 --> 00:16:47.495
Where did I lose them?

00:16:55.443 --> 00:16:56.637
Yajiro?

00:16:57.111 --> 00:17:00.205
This is as far as we made it before.

00:17:04.985 --> 00:17:06.680
Are you okay?

00:17:08.689 --> 00:17:11.920
It's no good. There are
some strong ones up ahead.

00:17:12.026 --> 00:17:12.856
What?

00:17:12.993 --> 00:17:15.018
One's using a Kensousen...

00:17:15.096 --> 00:17:15.863
Where's Doshi?

00:17:15.863 --> 00:17:17.228
<i>I don't know!
Where's Doshi?</i>

00:17:17.364 --> 00:17:19.059
<i>Over here, this way!</i>

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:21.259
I'll take care of this!

00:17:21.402 --> 00:17:22.198
Run!

00:17:22.303 --> 00:17:23.463
Shoot!

00:17:30.711 --> 00:17:36.149
I heard later that the guy who
was back there had heart problems.

00:17:36.283 --> 00:17:37.272
Um...

00:17:37.451 --> 00:17:41.751
And because of that, after the
battle, he left the Juttensen.

00:17:41.889 --> 00:17:45.052
If we had gone in, we may have won.

00:17:45.226 --> 00:17:46.158
No.

00:17:47.628 --> 00:17:52.895
Doshi's motive was to see who would
survive and who was the strongest.

00:17:53.134 --> 00:17:55.967
That's what he was after.

00:17:57.104 --> 00:18:01.302
He never intended to take Tenshi's life.

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:04.275
Kasumi...

00:18:04.879 --> 00:18:08.872
You were in on it with Doshi all along,
weren't you?

00:18:09.183 --> 00:18:14.177
I guess this is as far as you get
this time, too. How did you know?

00:18:14.321 --> 00:18:19.224
Inside the straw mat... it's far too heavy
for something a swordsman would carry.

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.692
It's faster this way.

00:18:30.304 --> 00:18:35.207
Do you really think it would last
if you unified the world that way?

00:18:48.022 --> 00:18:49.956
He's not here either.

00:18:50.057 --> 00:18:53.390
Damn, I've totally lost him.

00:18:54.261 --> 00:18:56.388
What should I do?

00:19:04.738 --> 00:19:05.796
Yes!

00:19:10.177 --> 00:19:11.769
Go!

00:19:22.823 --> 00:19:24.791
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:19:25.059 --> 00:19:27.789
We're having dinner dressed like this?

00:19:27.928 --> 00:19:31.955
An elegant dinner at a hotel.
This is perfect.

00:19:32.233 --> 00:19:33.131
Yes.

00:19:38.172 --> 00:19:39.366
I...

00:19:40.808 --> 00:19:42.571
Where are Yatchan and Mikan?

00:19:42.676 --> 00:19:46.703
Oh, they said they weren't
comfortable with fancy dinners.

00:19:47.548 --> 00:19:49.675
I'm sorry, Teppa.

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:52.717
But I'm going to see Tenshi.

00:19:52.853 --> 00:19:55.378
But I got us a room.

00:19:55.723 --> 00:19:58.123
Wait, I'll go with you!

00:19:59.927 --> 00:20:04.626
We were supposed to do this and that...
All my plans!

00:20:09.236 --> 00:20:11.636
How are you planning on getting in?

00:20:11.772 --> 00:20:13.467
Through the front gate, of course.

00:20:13.607 --> 00:20:18.135
You must be kidding! The castle
is under maximum security tonight.

00:20:18.445 --> 00:20:20.470
Teppa, you knew that, so you...

00:20:20.614 --> 00:20:24.050
I just wanted to spend
the night with you.

00:20:24.318 --> 00:20:26.013
Thank you, Teppa.

00:20:26.153 --> 00:20:29.816
But I haven't done anything wrong.

00:20:30.124 --> 00:20:32.718
I guess I can't stop you.

00:20:34.295 --> 00:20:35.592
Stop!

00:20:36.997 --> 00:20:38.555
Who are you!

00:20:39.099 --> 00:20:42.068
I, Rushuna Tendo have returned!

00:20:42.269 --> 00:20:44.999
I would like to see Tenshi.

00:20:45.172 --> 00:20:47.766
R-Rushuna Tendo!

00:21:06.126 --> 00:21:10.085
If necessary, my armored cloth
will protect you.

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:15.793
Thank you, but there's nothing to
worry about. Tenshi is on my side.

00:21:16.904 --> 00:21:18.599
I sure hope so.

00:21:31.852 --> 00:21:32.978
You...

00:21:33.153 --> 00:21:36.816
We have been waiting
for you, Rushuna Tendo.

00:21:36.957 --> 00:21:41.257
You have earned yourself the title
"Grenadier" as the topmost Senshi.

00:21:41.395 --> 00:21:43.795
<i>Grenadier</i>

00:21:44.164 --> 00:21:45.825
Grenadier?

00:21:46.900 --> 00:21:50.165
I am a Grenadier?

00:21:54.008 --> 00:21:55.339
Just you wait!

00:21:55.509 --> 00:21:59.104
I'm going to uncover what's
really going on here in Tento!

00:22:14.895 --> 00:22:24.531
<i>All alone,
so many nights I want to cry.</i>

00:22:25.606 --> 00:22:35.277
<i>Everyone dreams on
the road of the endless journey.</i>

00:22:36.583 --> 00:22:41.816
<i>Always believe in something,
and always lose something.</i>

00:22:41.989 --> 00:22:46.050
<i>I hold you.</i>

00:22:47.127 --> 00:22:54.863
<i>All the tears I shed
will turn into kindness.</i>

00:22:55.202 --> 00:22:57.295
<i>I'm sure.</i>

00:22:57.571 --> 00:23:02.702
<i>Don't be defeated by sadness.</i>

00:23:02.910 --> 00:23:08.348
<i>Keep your eye on tomorrow.</i>

00:23:08.549 --> 00:23:18.550
<i>You're not alone.
Everyone has dreams to come true.</i>

00:23:18.892 --> 00:23:29.700
<i>The winds of tomorrow will
bring the fragrance of kindness.</i>

00:23:29.870 --> 00:23:40.474
<i>It's a promise...
I'll always be by your side.</i>

00:23:42.616 --> 00:23:44.584
<i>Next Episode</i>

00:23:44.685 --> 00:23:49.486
Grenadier. That is the title
given to the strongest Senshi.

00:23:49.623 --> 00:23:54.492
A title for what? To show the
local warlords who holds the power?

00:23:54.628 --> 00:23:57.688
Taking control by force is wrong.

00:23:57.831 --> 00:24:01.096
Even if Tenshi says she's had
a change of heart...

00:24:01.201 --> 00:24:04.693
I can tell she's a fake!

00:24:04.938 --> 00:24:09.568
Next episode of "Grenadier,"
Showdown with Tenshi.

00:24:09.743 --> 00:24:12.576
Would you like to join me?
